@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. GET ALL: Listar todos los usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET BY ID: Obtener usuario con ID 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET BY ID: Usuario inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/999
Accept: application/json

### 4. POST: Crear un usuario válido (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lucia Fernandez",
  "email": "lucia.fernandez@example.com",
  "age": 28
}

### 5. POST: Datos inválidos (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "L",
  "email": "correo-no-valido",
  "age": 15
}

### 6. PUT: Actualizar usuario existente (200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana García Actualizada",
  "email": "ana.actualizada@example.com",
  "age": 26
}

### 7. DELETE: Eliminar usuario existente (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/2

